  "prefLabel": "Per 102.87 Signature",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 102.87 “Signature” means, unless otherwise specified, a handwritten signature or an electronic signature as defined by RSA 294-E:2, VIII, reprinted in Appendix B.\n\nSource. #10238, eff 3-18-13; renumbered by #10801 (from Per 102.57); ss by #13667, eff 6-22-23 (formerly Per 102.63); renumbered by #14065-A; renumbered by #14132-A; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.77), eff 12-1-25",
